te! Development was on hold for some time, but I'm finally getting back to working on the game, little by little.My game is registered for Steam Next Fest, and while there's still a lot of work to do, I'm happy to keep making progress and share it with you.New RoomsI've added new rooms to the game :Taxidermy Room (2F)A Puzzle Room (3F)Third Floor Entrance (3F)Attic (Will be changed) (3F)TutorialI've also added a small tutorial at the beginning o","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-18T11:02:10Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706686720","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:13:16Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4605350-1836506165563653","game_id":"steam-4605350","kind":"announcement","title":"Improved Demo","summary":"After some feedbacks, I've decided to update the demo and make it more enjoyable with :More clues for puzzlesExit Elevator DoorBetter feedback and impact for the battle systemMore brightness to the gameMore monsters early onQuicker IntroBetter UI","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-30T21:36:59Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165563653","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:13:16Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4605350-1835871199305507","game_id":"steam-4605350","kind":"announcement","title":"The Demo is Out!","summary":"Hi everyone!The demo is out, and you can finally try it for yourself.You can give me feedbacks on the community hub or on my discord server for the game :Discord ServerIf you'd like to support the development of my game, you can do so on my Patreon : Mathim Draw Patreon (get access to unreal project and assets of the game).I hope you'll enjoy the demo!Honestly I wanted to publish the demo for this Steam Fest, but I was too slow :(","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-18T21:08:23Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835871199305507","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:13:16Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4605350-1834602721188696","game_id":"steam-4605350","kind":"update","title":"Development Update","summary":"Hello everyone!The demo release is going to be slightly delayed. I literally only have TWO more rooms left to create in the game, and then I just need to briefly connect them to the story. After that, the demo will finally be ready!I’m slow with development, but I’ve never been this close to the finish line.Tank ControlsTank control is now fully integrated into the game, and you’ll be able to switch between modern control and tank control! I know this might sound surprising to some of you, there","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-04T20:28:11Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1834602721188696","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:13:16Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4605350-1832700592797889","game_id":"steam-4605350","kind":"announcement","title":"About the Game and the Demo","summary":"Hello to everyone interested in my game!I wanted to give you an update on the development of the game and talk a bit about what I’m currently planning for both now and the future.Demo ProgressCornered Cadavers is my first game on Steam. I’ve been developing it for about a year now, and at the moment I’m mainly improving the level design to create a smoother and less frustrating experience.There are still many things that need improvement, such as the combat animations and some of the cutscenes. ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-18T10:32:23Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1832700592797889","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:13:16Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4605350":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:55:40Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:55:40Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4605350":"2026-10-26T12:55:40Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4605350":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:55:40Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T12:55:40Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:55:40Z"},"4847160":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:55:40Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T12:55:40Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:55:40Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4605350","app_id":4605350,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:42Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"2355d24502b59d75a07b6f840d28a2160c9a4c7132c1ef53292c3c36a7e1c9c7","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"A fixed camera survival horror game with pre-rendered HD backgrounds.\r\nAce Optimi, attempting to rescue her missing uncle, finds herself trapped in a house lost within the eternal void. \r\nAce holds the key to escape, but something else in this house is searching for it as well...","publishers":[{"name":"Mathim Draw"}],"developers":[{"name":"Mathim Draw"}]},"release":{"is_coming_soon":true,"custom_release_date_message":"출시 예정","coming_soon_display":"text_comingsoon"},"trailers":{"highlights":[{"trailer_name":"Official Trailer","trailer_url_format":"steam/apps/${FILENAME}?t=1792570449","trailer_category":1,"microtrailer":[{"filename":"4605350/662410909/a063e680b2c7f52d13c66e37a